{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Capture FX parameter states across selected tracks (or take FX on items), recall them safely with envelope bypass, and write them as automation envelope points \u8212- at the cursor, or across a time selection.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Per-parameter checkboxes scope what gets recalled/written. Recall is a two-stage preview: first click overrides envelopes and applies the snapshot, second click cancels. Selection changes auto-cancel.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Snapshots persist per-project (saved into the .rpp via project ExtState), so they survive REAPER restarts.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Advanced random-walk automation system with intelligent parameter grouping. Features: FX-specific parameter groups, multiple iterations, render-to-takes, settings persistence. Uses REAL parameter values with smart exclusion based on actual loaded plugins.\par}
}
